                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is Mokobara's biggest advantage?</h3>
                                        <p>Design-first product + premium-accessible pricing + warranty engineering. Category-defining positioning in Indian premium luggage.</p>
                                        <h3>How does Mokobara compete with international luxury?</h3>
                                        <p>Doesn't try to. Positioned as premium-accessible, not luxury. Indian travellers who want quality without Rimowa / Tumi pricing.</p>
                                        <h3>Can new luggage brands compete?</h3>
                                        <p>In category niching (backpacks specialty, women's premium, adventure-focused) yes. Mokobara dominates mainstream premium travel luggage.</p>
                                        <h3>Should new premium D2C brands do retail?</h3>
                                        <p>For touch-important + high-AOV categories, yes at scale (₹40+ Cr ARR). Start D2C, add retail as brand experience layer.</p>
